{'symbol': 'KEYS', 'date': '2019-12-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'KEYSIGHT TECHNOLOGIES AND CUSTOMCELLS® COLLABORATE ON CELL FORMATION LINE AND RELATED TECHNOLOGY DEVELOPMENT', 'text': "KEYSIGHT TECHNOLOGIES, INC. ANNOUNCED THAT CUSTOMCELLS®, A LEADING PROVIDER OF SPECIAL LITHIUM-ION BATTERY CELLS, WILL INSTALL KEYSIGHT'S BATTERY CELL FORMATION LINE IN ITS MANUFACTURING FACILITY IN TÜBINGEN, GERMANY. THE COLLABORATION ALSO INCLUDES THE DEVELOPMENT AND VALIDATION OF NEW ALGORITHMS, SOFTWARE, INSTRUMENTATION, AND FORMATION/MEASUREMENT METHODS. KEYSIGHT’S CELL FORMATION LINE PROVIDES CUSTOMCELLS® WITH INDUSTRIAL CELL FORMATION, INCLUDING QUALITY MEASUREMENTS, SUCH AS DIRECT MEASUREMENT OF CELL SELF-DISCHARGE AND CELL IMPEDANCE SPECTROSCOPY. KEYSIGHT ALSO PROVIDED CUSTOMCELLS® A WIDE RANGE OF POUCH CELL FORM FACTORS. KEYSIGHT’S BATTERY CELL FORMATION LINE IS DESIGNED TO FORM POUCH CELLS OF UP TO 200 MILLIMETERS (MM) X 200 MM IN PRESSURE TRAYS UNDERGOING VARIOUS FORMATION PROCESSES AND CYCLES. KEYSIGHT’S CELL FORMATION SOFTWARE WILL LINK TOGETHER ALL FORMATION AND MEASUREMENT STATIONS TO PROVIDE SECURE, WEB-BASED CONTROL AND ACCESS TO DATA COLLECTED DURING THE FORMATION PROCESS. IN ADDITION, KEYSIGHT WILL PROVIDE CUSTOMCELLS® A PLATFORM FOR COOPERATIVE INVENTION AND DEPLOYMENT OF NEXT GENERATION MANUFACTURING SOLUTIONS, INCLUDING POWER ELECTRONICS AS WELL AS FIXTURING AND SOFTWARE COMPONENTS, ENABLING A BATTERY CELL MANUFACTURING PROCESS FOR POUCH CELLS IN A VARIETY OF SIZES."}{'symbol': 'KEYS', 'date': '2019-12-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'KEYSIGHT TECHNOLOGIES AND CUSTOMCELLS® COLLABORATE ON CELL FORMATION LINE AND RELATED TECHNOLOGY DEVELOPMENT', 'text': "KEYSIGHT TECHNOLOGIES, INC. ANNOUNCED THAT CUSTOMCELLS®, A LEADING PROVIDER OF SPECIAL LITHIUM-ION BATTERY CELLS, WILL INSTALL KEYSIGHT'S BATTERY CELL FORMATION LINE IN ITS MANUFACTURING FACILITY IN TÜBINGEN, GERMANY. THE COLLABORATION ALSO INCLUDES THE DEVELOPMENT AND VALIDATION OF NEW ALGORITHMS, SOFTWARE, INSTRUMENTATION, AN